WEBVTT

00:26:27.162 --> 00:26:31.000
to engage with us and with each other, with everyone around you,

00:26:31.000 --> 00:26:33.792
to help make the world richer, fairer,

00:26:33.792 --> 00:26:36.400
cooler and safer

00:26:36.400 --> 00:26:39.208
by together reinventing fire.

00:26:39.208 --> 00:26:41.067
Thank you.

00:26:41.067 --> 00:26:42.467
(Applause)